# Quick Reference

## Environment Variables
```bash
# backend/.env
SIMPLAMO_API_TOKEN=your_token_here
SIMPLAMO_TEAM_ID=60fd7f693e81570057440b4f
SIMPLAMO_SESSION_ID=68bfd79c1f6d94001b24c070
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
PORT=4000

# frontend/.env.local
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
```

## Install Commands
```bash
# Backend
nest new backend && cd backend
npm install @nestjs/config axios
npm install langchain @langchain/openai @langchain/core
npm install class-validator class-transformer zod

# Frontend
npx create-next-app@latest frontend --typescript --tailwind --app --src-dir
cd frontend
npm install @assistant-ui/react
npx shadcn@latest init
npx shadcn@latest add card badge button progress
```

## Thứ Tự Build (5 ngày theo brief)

### Day 1 — Simplamo Client + Tool đầu tiên
```
1. backend/src/simplamo/simplamo.client.ts   ← axios instance + all methods
2. backend/src/simplamo/simplamo.module.ts
3. backend/src/agents/goal/goal.tools.ts     ← chỉ listGoals() trước
4. Test thủ công: gọi listGoals() trong main(), xem JSON trả về
```

### Day 2 — Goal Agent
```
5. backend/src/agents/goal/goal.prompts.ts
6. backend/src/agents/goal/goal.agent.ts     ← createReactAgent với 3 tools
7. backend/src/chat/chat.controller.ts       ← POST /api/chat SSE
8. backend/src/chat/chat.service.ts
9. Test với curl, quan sát reasoning trace (verbose: true)
```

### Day 3 — Metrics + Action Agent
```
10. backend/src/agents/metrics/metrics.tools.ts  ← listMetrics, getMetricValues, getOffTrackMetrics, getTeamScorecard
11. backend/src/agents/metrics/metrics.agent.ts
12. backend/src/agents/action/action.tools.ts    ← listActions, createAction, updateActionStatus, parseNaturalDate
13. backend/src/agents/action/action.agent.ts
```

### Day 4 — Orchestrator + Frontend
```
14. backend/src/agents/orchestrator/orchestrator.agent.ts  ← classifyIntent (gpt-4o-mini) + routing
15. frontend/src/app/chat/page.tsx                         ← assistant-ui chat
16. frontend/src/app/dashboard/page.tsx                    ← goal cards + metrics
```

### Day 5 — Polish + Demo
```
17. Error handling edge cases
18. Test 13 câu chuẩn
19. Demo 15 phút
```

